WEBVTT

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:05.560
Many people were beaten
and thrown in jail.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.880
Others were murdered
like Jonathan Daniels.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:15.816
And yet, we are still, as a nation,

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.800
mired down

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.920
in the quicksand of racism.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.136
And everywhere I go around the nation,